# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
SVGS = ['<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">VÜCUDUN ORGANLARI VE BEŞ DUYU (الْجِسْمُ وَالْحَوَاسُّ الْخَمْسُ)</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">BAŞ VE VÜCUT ORGANLARI (أَعْضَاءُ الْجِسْمِ)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• جِسْمٌ : Vücut / Beden  |  رَأْسٌ : Baş / Kafa</text>\n  <text x="35" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• عَيْنٌ : Göz  |  أُذُنٌ : Kulak  |  أَنْفٌ : Burun</text>\n  <text x="35" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• فَمٌ : Ağız  |  لِسَانٌ : Dil  |  أَسْنَانٌ : Dişler</text>\n  <text x="35" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• يَدٌ : El  |  رِجْلٌ / قَدَمٌ : Bacak / Ayak</text>\n  <text x="35" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#1e3a8a">• مَعِدَةٌ : Mide  |  حَلْقٌ / حَنْجَرَةٌ : Boğaz</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">DUYU FİİLLERİ VE بـِ HARF-İ CERİ</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• أَرَى بِالْعَيْنِ : Göz ile görürüm</text>\n  <text x="370" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• أَسْمَعُ بِالْأُذُنِ : Kulak ile işitirim</text>\n  <text x="370" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• أَشُمُّ بِالْأَنْفِ : Burun ile koklarım</text>\n  <text x="370" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• أَذُوقُ بِاللِّسَانِ : Dil ile tadarım</text>\n  <text x="370" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#14532d">• أَلْمِسُ بِالْيَدِ : El ile dokunurum</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Vücutta çift bulunan organlar (عَيْنٌ، أُذُنٌ، يَدٌ، رِجْلٌ) Arapçada semâî müennes (dişil) kabul edilir.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">HASTALIK ŞİKÂYETLERİ VE MUAYENE KALIPLARI (فِي الْمُسْتَشْفَى)</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fef2f2" stroke="#dc2626" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#991b1b">HASTALIKLAR VE BELİRTİLER (الْأَمْرَاضُ)</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#7f1d1d">• أَلَمٌ : Ağrı / Sızı  |  صُدَاعٌ : Baş ağrısı</text>\n  <text x="35" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#7f1d1d">• نَزْلَةٌ / زُكَامٌ : Nezle / Soğuk algınlığı</text>\n  <text x="35" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#7f1d1d">• كُحَّةٌ / سُعَالٌ : Öksürük  |  مَغْصٌ : Karın sancısı</text>\n  <text x="35" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#7f1d1d">• ضَغْطٌ مُرْتَفِعٌ : Yüksek tansiyon</text>\n  <text x="35" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#7f1d1d">• حَرَارَةٌ مُرْتَفِعَةٌ / حُمَّى : Yüksek ateş</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#faf5ff" stroke="#9333ea" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#6b21a8">DOKTOR - HASTA DİYALOG KALIPLARI</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• مَا بِكَ / مَا بِكِ؟ : Neyin var? (Eril / Dişil)</text>\n  <text x="370" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• بِمَاذَا تَشْعُرُ؟ : Ne hissediyorsun?</text>\n  <text x="370" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• أَشْعُرُ بِأَلَمٍ فِي مَعِدَتِي : Midemde ağrı hissediyorum</text>\n  <text x="370" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• عِنْدِي صُدَاعٌ وَكُحَّةٌ : Baş ağrım ve öksürüğüm var</text>\n  <text x="370" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#581c87">• فَحَصَ الطَّبِيبُ الْمَرِيضَ : Doktor hastayı muayene etti</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">«شَفَاكَ اللّٰهُ» (Allah şifa versin) ve «لَا دَاعِيَ لِلْقَلَقِ» (Endişeye gerek yok) temel teselli ifadeleridir.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">TEDAVİ, TEMİZLİK VE SAĞLIKLI YAŞAM TAVSİYELERİ</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#fff7ed" stroke="#ea580c" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">TEDAVİ, HİJYEN VE BESLENME SÖZCÜKLERİ</text>\n  <text x="35" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• مُسْتَشْفَى : Hastane  |  صَيْدَلِيَّةٌ : Eczane</text>\n  <text x="35" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• دَوَاءٌ : İlaç  |  مُسَكِّنٌ : Ağrı kesici</text>\n  <text x="35" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• فُرْشَاةُ الْأَسْنَانِ : Diş fırçası  |  صَابُونٌ : Sabun</text>\n  <text x="35" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• الْغِذَاءُ الصِّحِّيُّ : Sağlıklı besin / gıda</text>\n  <text x="35" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#7c2d12">• الْخَضْرَوَاتُ وَالْفَوَاكِهُ : Sebzeler ve meyveler</text>\n  <rect x="358" y="42" width="320" height="175" rx="10" fill="#ecfdf5" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="518" y="64" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#065f46">TAVSİYE VE NEHİY (YASAKLAMA) KALIPLARI</text>\n  <text x="370" y="88" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• يَجِبُ عَلَيْكَ أَنْ تَسْتَرِيحَ : Dinlenmen gerekir</text>\n  <text x="370" y="112" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• تَنَاوَلِ الدَّوَاءَ بَعْدَ الطَّعَامِ : İlacı yemekten sonra al</text>\n  <text x="370" y="136" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• لَا تَأْكُلْ طَعَامًا ضَارًّا : Zararlı yiyecek yeme!</text>\n  <text x="370" y="160" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• لَا تَشْرَبْ مَاءً بَارِدًا : Soğuk su içme!</text>\n  <text x="370" y="184" font-size="11.2" fill="#064e3b">• كَمْ مَرَّةً فِي الْيَوْمِ؟ : Günde kaç kez / defa?</text>\n  <rect x="22" y="224" width="656" height="26" rx="6" fill="#e2e8f0"/>\n  <text x="350" y="241" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">Hadis-i Şerif: «اَلطُّهُورُ شَطْرُ الْإِيمَانِ» (Temizlik imanın yarısıdır — Sahîh-i Müslim, 223)</text>\n</svg>']

def uygula(v):
    for i, b in enumerate(v.get("bolumler", [])):
        if i < len(SVGS):
            b["gorsel"] = SVGS[i]
